{
 "contract": "intercycle.dev_label_scoring/1",
 "rule": "Statuses derived by twin/dev_labels.py build_scored from the label notes and strokes (labels/RULES.md r2): frames scored | duplicate (same clip sha256 and PTS); stroke windows in list order: not_needed (unlabelled supplementary reserve), duplicate (same press, clip sha256, t0, t1), ambiguous ('NOT SCORABLE:' note), not_running ('press not running' note, no strokes), scored (at least one BDC). Detections inside 'hidden' and 'edge' spans are not scored. Scored windows: exactly 10 per press with distinct clip sha256; a supplementary reserve is labelled only while its press has fewer than 10.",
